WEBVTT

00:46:00.196 --> 00:46:03.516
In the same way that if you were Colombia
in the last couple of years,

00:46:03.556 --> 00:46:04.716
you know, you found,

00:46:04.716 --> 00:46:07.676
even though you're working very closely
with an American ally,

00:46:07.716 --> 00:46:10.276
you're still dealing with Huawei and 5G.

00:46:10.636 --> 00:46:13.276
This is knock-on effects of all of this.

00:46:13.316 --> 00:46:16.436
These are countries
that are not going to take on

00:46:16.436 --> 00:46:17.796
significant economic burden,

00:46:17.836 --> 00:46:20.556
given how much they're suffering
right now geopolitically.

00:46:20.596 --> 00:46:22.676
BG: Another one is about sanctions.

00:46:22.716 --> 00:46:25.876
How do we even know when and how,

00:46:25.876 --> 00:46:28.796
at what point we start
rolling back sanctions?